<h3 local-id=3D"b37ca430f797" id=3D"PBiWorkspace-Security&amp;Permissions">=
Security &amp; Permissions</h3>
<p local-id=3D"d283deb813d1">Workspaces are configured to use <strong>Azure=
 AD / Entra ID security groups</strong> mapped to <strong>Power BI workspac=
e roles</strong>.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"be40e2e0d8f0">
<li local-id=3D"6bc3acc0-6493-4a39-b908-31546e2996b5">
<p local-id=3D"49d8d6eeaed0"><strong>Member</strong> role can typically:</p=
>
<ul local-id=3D"5c09fbc6-db13-4269-a35e-082ca8d73981">
<li local-id=3D"fe72aa7a-9c97-4f88-886b-e44c048db1f6">
<p local-id=3D"15d61e33ecfa">View reports and dashboards</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"2b8a7d3d-de22-467e-a766-f990b76d9e08">
<p local-id=3D"1fe4cbe4f645">Publish/update content</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"b2be408b-d616-43cc-8268-e74b86c0928c">
<p local-id=3D"503714b37b1f">Create apps</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"ecce66d3-2576-401f-a100-839bedfebbc5">
<p local-id=3D"9b6b25d5721c">Share content depending on workspace settings<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"17067389-5e0b-4676-a9ea-91c8effcb5c1">
<p local-id=3D"a80a795d4699"><strong>Contributor</strong> role can typicall=
y:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"1653c787-4e69-4a2b-b87a-c8280cd7f9bd">
<li local-id=3D"1821a598-a588-453c-995d-4d3744c6b19a">
<p local-id=3D"c72e1b2814f5">Create, edit, and delete reports, dashboards, =
and datasets</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"18ab3049-5db6-4174-8f52-01ed7990b7d2">
<p local-id=3D"34f8a5e129e0">Publish content</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"b3180454-62a2-40cc-8387-8c794d4e2257">
<p local-id=3D"1659199dd375">Cannot manage workspace access or settings</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
